  <item>
    <title>林俊杰的创作歌曲</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6b0394ed77e5b18a3331359b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6b0394ed77e5b18a3331359b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 01:26:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>林俊杰作为华语乐坛里在实力唱作人代表，早在其作为歌手出道前就已经为不少歌手创作过歌曲，迄今为止二十多年的音乐生涯里写给别人的歌将近二百首，其中不乏多首热曲金曲。</span><br><span>一起来听听部分JJ写给别人的歌，看看二十几首中你听过多少。</span></p><p><span>往期节目也曾分享过林俊杰将作品自己重新演绎编排的专辑</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63dd20c751a4e4150ab7b4a9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63dd20c751a4e4150ab7b4a9"><span>《她说》</span></a><span> ，大家更喜欢女歌手的演唱还是JJ本人的呢林俊杰的创作歌曲</span></p><p><strong><em><span>林俊杰的创作歌曲</span></em></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">00:05</a> 当你——王心凌</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="203">03:23</a> 凑热闹——BY</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a> 只对你有感觉——飞轮海&amp;田馥甄</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> 一眼万年——S.H.E</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="944">15:44</a> 心墙——郭静</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1168">19:28</a> 爱笑的眼睛——徐若瑄</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1433">23:53</a> 握不住的他——萧萧</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">27:11</a> 有我——王介安</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1852">30:52</a> 跟我走吧——潘玮柏</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2075">34:35</a> 回到最初——蔡淳佳</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2306">38:26</a> 这就是爱吗？——容祖儿</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a> 我很想爱他——Twins</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2805">46:45</a> 你给我听好——陈奕迅</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3082">51:22</a> 孤单说你忘了我——郭富城</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3367">56:07</a> 第三人称——蔡依林</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3649">1:00:49</a> 保护色——张韶涵</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3872">1:04:32</a> 末日之恋——张智成</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4148">1:09:08</a> 清楚——罗美玲</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4371">1:12:51</a> 一个人住——阿杜</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4624">1:17:04</a> 路人——江美琪</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4909">1:21:49</a> 在你怀里的微笑——杨丞琳</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5143">1:25:43</a> 记得——张惠妹</span></p>]]></description>
