  <item>
    <title>经济上行时期的歌2.0</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a36779a75ba9e0c53365aed</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a36779a75ba9e0c53365aed</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 Jun 2026 11:26:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>前几期发经济上行时期的歌时收到了众多友友的积极反馈，而我本来挑选的歌单也不止于那期的13首，很乐意再制作多一期。</span></p><p><span>找歌选歌的时候有些怀念那些年的流行舞曲，电子元素，跳动活泼的编曲律动都是积极向上腾飞的感觉，想起幼儿园的时候都是听着这种舞曲做操跳舞的，很是开心。</span></p><p><strong><span>经济上行时期的歌2.0</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">00:05</a> Happy 2000——黎明</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="196">03:16</a> 花花宇宙——陈慧琳</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="426">07:06</a> Super Star——S.H.E</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="617">10:17</a> 心电心——王心凌</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="841">14:01</a> 爱疯头——罗志祥</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1028">17:08</a> 招牌动作——蔡依林</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1219">20:19</a> 三国恋——Tank</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> 我要飞——张惠妹</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> 龙拳——周杰伦</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a> 燕尾蝶——梁静茹</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2183">36:23</a> 不潮不用花钱——林俊杰</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2411">40:11</a> Tic Tac Toe——徐洁儿</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2652">44:12</a> 浪漫爱——江语晨</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2896">48:16</a> 小宇宙——李宇春</span></p><p><span>愿你听得开心</span></p>]]></description>
